Package: dataki-client
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.22), libayatana-appindicator3-1
Maintainer: dataNet.ovh Ltd. <support@datanet.ovh>
Homepage: https://ai.datanet.ovh
Description: Native client for dataKI
 Native desktop client for the dataKI AI chat service. Sign in through your
 browser, then chat with streaming responses, model selection and history
 without keeping a browser open.
